  "text": "Asymbolia [Gr. a + snmbolon , symbol]: Ger. Asymbolie ; Fr. asymbolie ; Ital. asimbolia . Loss of the power of forming or understanding signs or symbols of expression. The term is also used by Finkelnburg as a general synonym of aphasia. Cf. ASEMIA. ( J.J . - E.M .)",
